{"id": "2cW90gNXgkxf", "owner": "showcase", "title": "TRIUMP Trade — TRMP/USDC · Robinhood Chain Terminal", "createdAt": 1790349205511, "updatedAt": 1790349411501, "versions": [{"prompt": "Trading terminal \"TRIUMP Trade\" on Robinhood Chain — candlestick chart drawn in SVG, order book, buy/sell panel, live trades feed, portfolio bar. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>TRIUMP Trade — TRMP/USDC · Robinhood Chain Terminal</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#050b09;\n  --panel:#07110d;\n  --panel-2:#091712;\n  --green:#39ff14;\n  --blue:#5bd1ff;\n  --line:rgba(57,255,20,.14);\n  --line-b:rgba(91,209,255,.16);\n  --txt:#d6f2e2;\n  --mut:#6f8d7e;\n  --mut2:#4c6559;\n  --mono:\"JetBrains Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;\n  --grot:\"Space Grotesk\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml,body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--grot);}\nbody{min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}\n/* texture */\n.tex{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:900;}\n.tex::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(57,255,20,.045) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(57,255,20,.035) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:32px 32px;mask-image:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%,#000 30%,rgba(0,0,0,.35) 100%);}\n.tex::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px,rgba(0,0,0,.35) 2px 3px);opacity:.5;}\n.glowtop{position:fixed;left:50%;top:-320px;width:1100px;height:520px;transform:translateX(-50%);\n  background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%,rgba(57,255,20,.20),rgba(57,255,20,0) 70%);filter:blur(30px);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}\n.glowblue{position:fixed;right:-240px;top:40%;width:700px;height:600px;\n  background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%,rgba(91,209,255,.13),rgba(91,209,255,0) 70%);filter:blur(30px);pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}\n\n.terminal{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px 12px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;min-height:100vh;}\n@media(min-width:1180px){ .terminal{height:100vh;padding:10px 16px 10px;} }\n\n/* panels */\n.panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(9,23,18,.92),rgba(5,11,9,.92));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;position:relative;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.6),0 18px 40px -24px rgba(57,255,20,.35),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(57,255,20,.07);}\n.panel::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:10px;pointer-events:none;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(57,255,20,.12),transparent 25%);mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.6}\n.phead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}\n.phead h2{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#bff5cd}\n.phead .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:.1em}\n\n/* header */\nheader.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(57,255,20,.07),rgba(5,11,9,.9) 35%,rgba(91,209,255,.06));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.mark{width:30px;height:30px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(57,255,20,.7))}\n.brand b{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:700}\n.brand b span{color:var(--green)}\n.chainchip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line-b);border-radius:999px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.08em;\n  background:rgba(91,209,255,.06)}\nnav.main{display:flex;gap:2px}\nnav.main a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut);text-decoration:none;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:6px}\nnav.main a:hover{color:var(--txt);background:rgba(57,255,20,.06)}\nnav.main a.on{color:#0a1a0c;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(57,255,20,.45)}\n.hright{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.wallet{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:#bff5cd;background:rgba(57,255,20,.05)}\n.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}\n@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.35}}\n.btn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid var(--line-b);background:rgba(91,209,255,.08);color:var(--blue);\n  padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}\n.btn:hover{background:rgba(91,209,255,.16);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(91,209,255,.25)}\n\n/* portfolio bar */\n.portfolio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr repeat(4,1fr) 1.15fr;gap:0;align-items:stretch;}\n.pcell{padding:10px 14px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}\n.pcell:last-child{border-right:none}\n.plab{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut2)}\n.pval{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.pval small{font-size:11px;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:500;color:var(--mut)}\n.up{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(57,255,20,.45)}\n.dn{color:var(--blue);text-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(91,209,255,.4)}\n.alloc{display:flex;height:6px;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);margin-top:2px}\n.alloc i{display:block;height:100%}\n.alegend{display:flex;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut);flex-wrap:wrap}\n.alegend b{font-weight:500;color:#bff5cd}\n.sq{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:1px}\n\n/* workspace */\n.workspace{display:grid;gap:10px;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);flex:1;min-height:0}\n@media(min-width:1180px){ .workspace{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 278px 318px;} }\n.colL{display:grid;grid-template-rows:minmax(280px,1fr) 186px;gap:10px;min-height:0}\n.colM,.colR{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;min-height:0}\n\n/* chart panel */\n.chartpanel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}\n.instrument{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap}\n.pairbox{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.pairico{width:34px;height:34px}\n.pair h1{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1}\n.pair .sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:3px}\n.bigprice{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}\n#bigPrice{font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1}\n.chg{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);}\n.stats{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-left:auto;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}\n.stat .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--mut2);text-transform:uppercase}\n.stat .v{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:#c9ecd7;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.chartbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap}\n.tf{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--mut);border:1px solid transparent;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;background:none}\n.tf:hover{color:var(--txt)}\n.tf.on{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.35);background:rgba(57,255,20,.08);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(57,255,20,.15) inset}\n.ohlc{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--mut);display:flex;gap:11px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.ohlc b{font-weight:500}\n.chartwrap{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:250px}\n#chart{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n.cursorTip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,0);background:rgba(5,11,9,.95);border:1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;line-height:1.6;white-space:nowrap;z-index:5;box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(0,0,0,.8)}\n\n/* trades feed */\n.feed{overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.feedhead,.orow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr 1fr 1fr 96px;gap:8px;padding:5px 14px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.feedhead{color:var(--mut2);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:8px}\n#tradeList{overflow:hidden;flex:1}\n.orow{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(57,255,20,.05);color:#a9cdb9}\n.orow .side{font-weight:700}\n.orow.newrow{animation:slidein .45s ease}\n@keyframes slidein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px);background:rgba(57,255,20,.1)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n.wallethash{color:var(--mut2);text-align:right}\n\n/* order book */\n.obhead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:6px;padding:6px 12px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.obside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}\n.obrow{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:6px;padding:3px 12px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer}\n.obrow .depth{position:absolute;top:1px;bottom:1px;right:0;opacity:.14;border-radius:2px}\n.obrow span{position:relative;z-index:1}\n.obrow .sz,.obrow .tot{text-align:right;color:#a9cdb9}\n.obrow:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}\n.ask .px{color:var(--blue)} .ask .depth{background:var(--blue)}\n.bid .px{color:var(--green)} .bid .depth{background:var(--green)}\n.spread{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px;border-block:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(57,255,20,.04);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}\n.spread .mid{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--grot);letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.obfoot{display:flex;height:5px;margin:8px 12px 10px;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}\n\n/* ticket */\n.tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px 0}\n.tab{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:9px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);color:var(--mut);font-weight:700}\n.tab.on.buy{background:rgba(57,255,20,.14);border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.5);color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(57,255,20,.18)}\n.tab.on.sell{background:rgba(91,209,255,.14);border-color:rgba(91,209,255,.5);color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(91,209,255,.18)}\n.ticket{padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n.seg{display:flex;gap:4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px}\n.seg button{flex:1;padding:6px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:none;color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.seg button.on{color:#bff5cd;background:rgba(57,255,20,.09);border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.3)}\n.field{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.35);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.field:focus-within{border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.45);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(57,255,20,.15),0 0 20px -6px rgba(57,255,20,.45)}\n.field label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mut2);min-width:50px}\n.field input{flex:1;background:none;border:none;outline:none;color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:0}\n.field .unit{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}\n.chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:5px}\n.chips button{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;padding:6px 0;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer}\n.chips button:hover{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(57,255,20,.4)}\ninput[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;width:100%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green) var(--p,25%),rgba(255,255,255,.1) var(--p,25%));outline:none}\ninput[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--green);cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #050b09}\ninput[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:13px;height:13px;border:2px solid #050b09;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--green);cursor:pointer}\n.sumrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--mut)}\n.sumrow b{color:#c9ecd7;font-weight:500}\n.submit{width:100%;padding:13px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--grot);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  background:var(--green);color:#041206;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(57,255,20,.4),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n.submit:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}\n.submit.sell{background:var(--blue);color:#03151f;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(91,209,255,.4),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25)}\n.hint{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut2);line-height:1.6;text-align:center}\n\n/* positions */\n.pos{padding:4px 0 8px}\n.posrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:4px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(57,255,20,.06)}\n.posrow:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n.posrow .n{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.posrow .m{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut2);margin-top:2px}\n.posrow .r{text-align:right;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.posrow .r small{display:block;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut2);margin-top:2px}\n\n/* status */\n.status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--mut);flex-wrap:wrap;background:rgba(7,17,13,.85)}\n.status b{color:#bff5cd;font-weight:500}\n.status .sep{flex:1}\n.blink{color:var(--green);animation:pulse 1.2s infinite}\n::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;height:6px}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(57,255,20,.2);border-radius:3px}\n::selection{background:rgba(57,255,20,.3)}\n@media(max-width:1179px){\n  .portfolio{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .pcell{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .colL{grid-template-rows:380px 220px}\n  nav.main{display:none}\n  .stats{width:100%;margin-left:0}\n}\n@media(max-width:640px){\n  .portfolio{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  #bigPrice{font-size:27px}\n  .feedhead,.orow{grid-template-columns:56px 1fr 1fr;}\n  .orow .tot,.feedhead .tot,.wallethash,.feedhead .wallethash{display:none}\n  .terminal{padding:8px}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#39ff14;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Unbounded\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"terminal\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/show-3.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>T</i>TRIUMP Trade</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Terminal</a><a href=\"#\">Perps</a><a href=\"#\">Pools</a><a href=\"#\">Docs</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Start trading</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>Trading terminal · Robinhood Chain</span><h1><em>Trade</em></h1><p>Trade the chain at the speed of thought. Deep books, zero-lag fills.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Start trading</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  \n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"glowtop\"></div><div class=\"glowblue\"></div><div class=\"tex\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"terminal\">\n\n  <header class=\"bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <defs><linearGradient id=\"g1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#5bd1ff\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n        <path d=\"M4 5h24v5h-9.5v17h-5V10H4z\" fill=\"url(#g1)\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"24\" width=\"7\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#39ff14\"/><rect x=\"21\" y=\"19\" width=\"7\" height=\"3\" fill=\"#5bd1ff\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div>\n        <b>TRIUMP<span>·</span>TRADE</b>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--mut2);margin-top:1px\">MATCHING ENGINE v4.2</div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"chainchip\">◇ ROBINHOOD CHAIN · MAINNET</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"main\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"on\">Terminal</a><a href=\"#\">Perps</a><a href=\"#\">Pools</a><a href=\"#\">Vaults</a><a href=\"#\">Bridge</a><a href=\"#\">Docs</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"hright\">\n      <div class=\"wallet\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>0x7F3c…A91d <span style=\"color:var(--mut2)\">|</span> <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">1.884 ETH</span></div>\n      <button class=\"btn\">Deposit</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"panel portfolio\" aria-label=\"Portfolio overview\">\n    <div class=\"pcell\">\n      <span class=\"plab\">Portfolio Equity</span>\n      <div class=\"pval\" id=\"equity\">$482,193.40</div>\n      <div class=\"alloc\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <i style=\"width:46%;background:var(--green)\"></i><i style=\"width:27%;background:var(--blue)\"></i>\n        <i style=\"width:16%;background:rgba(57,255,20,.45)\"></i><i style=\"width:11%;background:rgba(91,209,255,.4)\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alegend\"><span><i class=\"sq\" style=\"background:var(--green)\"></i>TRMP <b>46%</b></span><span><i class=\"sq\" style=\"background:var(--blue)\"></i>ETH <b>27%</b></span><span><i class=\"sq\" style=\"background:rgba(57,255,20,.45)\"></i>USDC <b>16%</b></span><span><i class=\"sq\" style=\"background:rgba(91,209,255,.4)\"></i>Other <b>11%</b></span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pcell\"><span class=\"plab\">Unrealized PnL · 24h</span><div class=\"pval up\" id=\"pnl\">+$28,411.62</div><span class=\"plab\" style=\"color:var(--mut)\">+6.26% vs. yesterday</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pcell\"><span class=\"plab\">Buying Power</span><div class=\"pval\" id=\"bp\">$96,540.00 <small>USDC</small></div><span class=\"plab\" style=\"color:var(--mut)\">3.2× cross margin</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pcell\"><span class=\"plab\">Margin Ratio</span><div class=\"pval\">12.4%<small> / 80%</small></div>\n      <div class=\"alloc\"><i style=\"width:15.5%;background:var(--green)\"></i></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pcell\"><span class=\"plab\">Open Orders</span><div class=\"pval\">7 <small>· 2 TRIGGER</small></div><span class=\"plab\" style=\"color:var(--mut)\">Filled today: 118</span></div>\n    <div class=\"pcell\">\n      <span class=\"plab\">Equity Curve · 7D</span>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 42\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <defs><linearGradient id=\"spg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\" stop-opacity=\".45\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n        <path d=\"M0 34 L14 30 L28 33 L42 24 L56 27 L70 18 L84 22 L98 14 L112 19 L126 11 L140 15 L154 8 L168 12 L182 5 L200 7 L200 42 L0 42Z\" fill=\"url(#spg)\"/>\n        <path d=\"M0 34 L14 30 L28 33 L42 24 L56 27 L70 18 L84 22 L98 14 L112 19 L126 11 L140 15 L154 8 L168 12 L182 5 L200 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px #39ff14)\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <main class=\"workspace\">\n    <!-- LEFT -->\n    <div class=\"colL\">\n      <section class=\"panel chartpanel\" aria-label=\"Price chart\">\n        <div class=\"instrument\">\n          <div class=\"pairbox\">\n            <svg class=\"pairico\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#39ff14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n              <path d=\"M9 12h16v3.6h-6.2V25h-3.6v-9.4H9z\" fill=\"#39ff14\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5bd1ff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 40\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"pair\">\n              <h1>TRMP / USDC</h1>\n              <div class=\"sub\">SPOT · RHC-DEX · TIER 1</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bigprice\">\n            <div id=\"bigPrice\" class=\"up\">128.4270</div>\n            <span class=\"chg up\" id=\"chgPill\">+4.83%</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stats\">\n            <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"k\">24h High</span><span class=\"v\" id=\"hi\">131.9042</span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"k\">24h Low</span><span class=\"v\" id=\"lo\">118.6117</span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"k\">24h Vol</span><span class=\"v\">14.82M TRMP</span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"k\">Open Interest</span><span class=\"v\">$212.4M</span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"k\">Funding · 1h</span><span class=\"v up\">+0.0091%</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chartbar\">\n          <button class=\"tf\">1m</button><button class=\"tf\">5m</button><button class=\"tf on\">15m</button><button class=\"tf\">1H</button><button class=\"tf\">4H</button><button class=\"tf\">1D</button>\n          <span style=\"width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--line);margin:0 6px\"></span>\n          <button class=\"tf\">Candles</button><button class=\"tf\">Depth</button><button class=\"tf\">MA(9)</button>\n          <div class=\"ohlc\" id=\"ohlc\"><span>O <b class=\"up\">126.11</b></span><span>H <b class=\"up\">129.84</b></span><span>L <b class=\"dn\">125.73</b></span><span>C <b class=\"up\">128.43</b></span><span>VOL <b>384.2K</b></span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chartwrap\">\n          <svg id=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 420\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Candlestick chart of TRMP/USDC\"></svg>\n          <div class=\"cursorTip\" id=\"tip\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"panel feed\" aria-label=\"Live trades\">\n        <div class=\"phead\"><h2>Live Trades · On-chain</h2><span class=\"tag\"><span class=\"blink\">●</span> STREAMING · 14ms</span></div>\n        <div class=\"feedhead\"><span>Side</span><span>Price</span><span>Size (TRMP)</span><span class=\"tot\">Value</span><span class=\"wallethash\">Wallet / Block</span></div>\n        <div id=\"tradeList\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE: order book -->\n    <div class=\"colM\">\n      <section class=\"panel\" style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div class=\"phead\"><h2>Order Book</h2><span class=\"tag\">0.01 ▾</span></div>\n        <div class=\"obhead\"><span>Price (USDC)</span><span style=\"text-align:right\">Size</span><span style=\"text-align:right\">Total</span></div>\n        <div class=\"obside\" id=\"asks\" style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"spread\">\n          <div><div class=\"mid up\" id=\"obMid\">128.4270</div><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:var(--mut2);letter-spacing:.12em\">MID PRICE</span></div>\n          <div style=\"text-align:right;color:var(--mut)\">SPREAD<br><b style=\"color:var(--blue)\" id=\"obSpread\">0.0120 · 0.9bp</b></div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"bids\" style=\"flex:1\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:0 12px 4px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--mut)\">\n          <span>BIDS <b style=\"color:var(--green)\" id=\"bidPct\">58%</b></span><span><b style=\"color:var(--blue)\" id=\"askPct\">42%</b> ASKS</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"obfoot\"><i id=\"bidBar\" style=\"width:58%;background:var(--green);height:100%;display:block\"></i><i id=\"askBar\" style=\"width:42%;background:var(--blue);height:100%;display:block\"></i></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT: ticket + positions -->\n    <div class=\"colR\">\n      <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Order ticket\">\n        <div class=\"tabs\">\n          <button class=\"tab buy on\" id=\"tabBuy\">Buy / Long</button>\n          <button class=\"tab sell\" id=\"tabSell\">Sell / Short</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ticket\">\n          <div class=\"seg\" id=\"typeSeg\"><button class=\"on\">Limit</button><button>Market</button><button>Stop</button><button>TWAP</button></div>\n          <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"fPrice\">Price</label><input id=\"fPrice\" value=\"128.4270\" inputmode=\"decimal\"><span class=\"unit\">USDC</span></div>\n          <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"fAmt\">Amount</label><input id=\"fAmt\" value=\"187.50\" inputmode=\"decimal\"><span class=\"unit\">TRMP</span></div>\n          <input type=\"range\" id=\"slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"25\" aria-label=\"Percent of buying power\">\n          <div class=\"chips\"><button data-p=\"25\">25%</button><button data-p=\"50\">50%</button><button data-p=\"75\">75%</button><button data-p=\"100\">MAX</button></div>\n          <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"fTot\">Total</label><input id=\"fTot\" value=\"24,080.06\" inputmode=\"decimal\"><span class=\"unit\">USDC</span></div>\n          <div class=\"sumrow\"><span>Available</span><b>96,540.00 USDC</b></div>\n          <div class=\"sumrow\"><span>Est. fee · maker 0.02%</span><b id=\"fee\">4.82 USDC</b></div>\n          <div class=\"sumrow\"><span>Slippage tolerance</span><b>0.30%</b></div>\n          <button class=\"submit\" id=\"submitBtn\">Buy TRMP</button>\n          <p class=\"hint\">Settles on Robinhood Chain · avg. finality 0.4s<br>Gas sponsored for orders &gt; 10,000 USDC</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"panel pos\" aria-label=\"Open positions\" style=\"min-height:0;overflow:auto\">\n        <div class=\"phead\"><h2>Open Positions</h2><span class=\"tag\">3 ACTIVE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"posrow\"><div><div class=\"n\">TRMP <span style=\"color:var(--green);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px\">LONG 3×</span></div><div class=\"m\">1,720 @ 111.80 · liq 74.20</div></div>\n          <div class=\"r up\">+$28,552<small>+14.85%</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"posrow\"><div><div class=\"n\">ETH <span style=\"color:var(--blue);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px\">SHORT 2×</span></div><div class=\"m\">14.5 @ 3,418.20 · liq 4,902</div></div>\n          <div class=\"r dn\">−$1,204<small>−2.43%</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"posrow\"><div><div class=\"n\">RHC <span style=\"color:var(--green);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px\">LONG 1×</span></div><div class=\"m\">9,400 @ 2.114 · spot</div></div>\n          <div class=\"r up\">+$1,063<small>+5.35%</small></div></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"status\">\n    <span>NODE <b>rhc-eu-west-3</b></span>\n    <span>BLOCK <b id=\"block\">18,442,917</b></span>\n    <span>LATENCY <b class=\"blink\">14ms</b></span>\n    <span>GAS <b>0.0041 gwei</b></span>\n    <span class=\"sep\"></span>\n    <span>ENGINE LOAD <b>34%</b></span>\n    <span>SESSION PNL <b class=\"up\" id=\"sess\">+$4,118.90</b></span>\n    <span>© 2025 TRIUMP LABS</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n/* ---------- utils ---------- */\nconst $=s=>document.querySelector(s);\nconst rn=(a,b)=>a+Math.random()*(b-a);\nconst f=(n,d=2)=>n.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:d,maximumFractionDigits:d});\n\n/* ---------- candle data ---------- */\nconst N=72; let candles=[], price=128.427;\n(function seed(){\n  let p=104;\n  for(let i=0;i<N;i++){\n    const o=p, drift=(Math.random()-0.44)*0.017;\n    const c=Math.max(60,o*(1+drift));\n    const h=Math.max(o,c)*(1+Math.random()*0.006), l=Math.min(o,c)*(1-Math.random()*0.006);\n    candles.push({o,h,l,c,v:rn(120,520)});\n    p=c;\n  }\n  price=candles[N-1].c;\n})();\n\nconst W=1000,H=420,PL=6,PR=62,PT=14,VOLH=62,TIMEH=20;\nconst CH=H-PT-VOLH-TIMEH-8;\nconst svg=$('#chart');\nfunction ns(t,a){const e=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg',t);for(const k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);return e;}\n\nfunction render(){\n  svg.innerHTML='';\n  const step=(W-PL-PR)/candles.length;\n  const hi=Math.max(...candles.map(c=>c.h)), lo=Math.min(...candles.map(c=>c.l));\n  const pad=(hi-lo)*0.08, max=hi+pad, min=lo-pad;\n  const y=p=>PT+(max-p)/(max-min)*CH;\n  const x=i=>PL+i*step+step/2;\n  const vmax=Math.max(...candles.map(c=>c.v));\n\n  const defs=ns('defs');\n  defs.innerHTML=`<linearGradient id=\"fillg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n    <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\" stop-opacity=\".16\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#39ff14\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></linearGradient>\n    <filter id=\"bloom\" x=\"-50%\" y=\"-50%\" width=\"200%\" height=\"200%\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2.2\" result=\"b\"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"b\"/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"/></feMerge></filter>`;\n  svg.appendChild(defs);\n\n  // grid + price axis\n  for(let i=0;i<=5;i++){\n    const gy=PT+i*CH/5, v=max-(max-min)*i/5;\n    svg.appendChild(ns('line',{x1:PL,x2:W-PR,y1:gy,y2:gy,stroke:'rgba(57,255,20,.08)','stroke-width':1}));\n    const t=ns('text',{x:W-PR+8,y:gy+3.5,fill:'#4c6559','font-size':10,'font-family':'JetBrains Mono, monospace'});\n    t.textContent=v.toFixed(2); svg.appendChild(t);\n  }\n  for(let i=0;i<candles.length;i+=12){\n    svg.appendChild(ns('line',{x1:x(i),x2:x(i),y1:PT,y2:PT+CH,stroke:'rgba(57,255,20,.05)','stroke-width':1}));\n    const t=ns('text',{x:x(i),y:H-4,fill:'#4c6559','font-size':9,'font-family':'JetBrains Mono, monospace','text-anchor':'middle'});\n    const mins=(candles.length-i)*15; const d=new Date(Date.now()-mins*60000);\n    t.textContent=String(d.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(Math.floor(d.getMinutes()/15)*15).padStart(2,'0');\n    svg.appendChild(t);\n  }\n\n  // area under closes\n  let path='M '+x(0)+' '+y(candles[0].c);\n  candles.forEach((c,i)=>path+=' L '+x(i)+' '+y(c.c));\n  svg.appendChild(ns('path',{d:path+` L ${x(candles.length-1)} ${PT+CH} L ${x(0)} ${PT+CH} Z`,fill:'url(#fillg)'}));\n\n  // MA9\n  let ma='';\n  candles.forEach((c,i)=>{ if(i>=8){ let s=0; for(let k=i-8;k<=i;k++)s+=candles[k].c; ma+=(ma?' L ':'M ')+x(i)+' '+y(s/9);} });\n  svg.appendChild(ns('path',{d:ma,fill:'none',stroke:'#5bd1ff','stroke-width':1.4,opacity:.85,filter:'url(#bloom)'}));\n\n  // volume + candles\n  const g=ns('g');\n  candles.forEach((c,i)=>{\n    const up=c.c>=c.o, col=up?'#39ff14':'#5bd1ff';\n    const vh=(c.v/vmax)*VOLH;\n    g.appendChild(ns('rect',{x:x(i)-step*0.3,y:H-TIMEH-vh,width:step*0.6,height:vh,fill:col,opacity:.22}));\n    g.appendChild(ns('line',{x1:x(i),x2:x(i),y1:y(c.h),y2:y(c.l),stroke:col,'stroke-width':1.1,opacity:.9}));\n    const top=y(Math.max(c.o,c.c)), bh=Math.max(1.2,Math.abs(y(c.o)-y(c.c)));\n    g.appendChild(ns('rect',{x:x(i)-step*0.3,y:top,width:step*0.6,height:bh,fill:col,opacity:up?.95:.6,stroke:col,'stroke-width':.8}));\n  });\n  g.setAttribute('filter','url(#bloom)');\n  svg.appendChild(g);\n\n  // last price line\n  const last=candles[candles.length-1], ly=y(last.c), lc=last.c>=last.o?'#39ff14':'#5bd1ff';\n  svg.appendChild(ns('line',{x1:PL,x2:W-PR,y1:ly,y2:ly,stroke:lc,'stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'5 4',opacity:.7}));\n  svg.appendChild(ns('rect',{x:W-PR+2,y:ly-9,width:58,height:18,rx:3,fill:lc}));\n  const lt=ns('text',{x:W-PR+8,y:ly+4,fill:'#041206','font-size':10.5,'font-weight':700,'font-family':'JetBrains Mono, monospace'});\n  lt.textContent=last.c.toFixed(3); svg.appendChild(lt);\n\n  svg._meta={step,min,max,y,x};\n}\nrender();\n\n/* crosshair */\nconst tip=$('#tip'), wrap=document.querySelector('.chartwrap');\nsvg.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n  const r=svg.getBoundingClientRect(); const rel=(e.clientX-r.left)/r.width*W;\n  const i=Math.max(0,Math.min(candles.length-1,Math.round((rel-PL)/svg._meta.step-0.5)));\n  const c=candles[i], up=c.c>=c.o, col=up?'#39ff14':'#5bd1ff';\n  $('#ohlc').innerHTML=`<span>O <b style=\"color:${col}\">${c.o.toFixed(2)}</b></span><span>H <b class=\"up\">${c.h.toFixed(2)}</b></span><span>L <b class=\"dn\">${c.l.toFixed(2)}</b></span><span>C <b style=\"color:${col}\">${c.c.toFixed(2)}</b></span><span>VOL <b>${f(c.v,1)}K</b></span>`;\n  tip.style.opacity=1;\n  tip.style.left=Math.min(r.width-90,Math.max(70,(e.clientX-r.left)))+'px';\n  tip.style.top=(svg._meta.y(c.h)/H*r.height-64)+'px';\n  tip.innerHTML=`<span style=\"color:${col}\">${c.c.toFixed(4)} USDC</span><br><span style=\"color:#6f8d7e\">Δ ${((c.c/c.o-1)*100).toFixed(2)}% · vol ${f(c.v,1)}K</span>`;\n});\nsvg.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{tip.style.opacity=0;});\n\n/* ---------- order book ---------- */\nfunction book(){\n  const asks=[],bids=[]; let ca=0,cb=0;\n  for(let i=0;i<11;i++){\n    const sz=rn(20,900); ca+=sz;\n    asks.push({p:price+0.006+i*rn(0.008,0.022),s:sz,t:ca});\n  }\n  for(let i=0;i<11;i++){\n    const sz=rn(20,900); cb+=sz;\n    bids.push({p:price-0.006-i*rn(0.008,0.022),s:sz,t:cb});\n  }\n  const maxT=Math.max(ca,cb);\n  $('#asks').innerHTML=asks.slice().reverse().map(a=>row(a,'ask',maxT)).join('');\n  $('#bids').innerHTML=bids.map(b=>row(b,'bid',maxT)).join('');\n  $('#obMid').textContent=price.toFixed(4);\n  $('#obSpread').textContent=(asks[0].p-bids[0].p).toFixed(4)+' · '+(((asks[0].p-bids[0].p)/price)*10000).toFixed(1)+'bp';\n  const bp=Math.round(cb/(ca+cb)*100);\n  $('#bidPct').textContent=bp+'%'; $('#askPct').textContent=(100-bp)+'%';\n  $('#bidBar').style.width=bp+'%'; $('#askBar').style.width=(100-bp)+'%';\n}\nfunction row(o,cls,maxT){\n  return `<div class=\"obrow ${cls}\" data-p=\"${o.p.toFixed(4)}\"><div class=\"depth\" style=\"width:${(o.t/maxT*100).toFixed(1)}%\"></div>\n  <span class=\"px\">${o.p.toFixed(4)}</span><span class=\"sz\">${f(o.s,1)}</span><span class=\"tot\">${f(o.t,0)}</span></div>`;\n}\nbook();\ndocument.addEventListener('click',e=>{const r=e.target.closest('.obrow'); if(r){$('#fPrice').value=r.dataset.p; recalc();}});\n\n/* ---------- trades feed ---------- */\nconst list=$('#tradeList'); const hash=()=>'0x'+Math.random().toString(16).slice(2,6)+'…'+Math.random().toString(16).slice(2,6);\nfunction trade(){\n  const buy=Math.random()>.47, p=price+rn(-0.05,0.05), s=rn(3,2400);\n  const el=document.createElement('div');\n  el.className='orow newrow';\n  el.innerHTML=`<span class=\"side\" style=\"color:${buy?'var(--green)':'var(--blue)'}\">${buy?'BUY':'SELL'}</span>\n  <span style=\"color:${buy?'var(--green)':'var(--blue)'}\">${p.toFixed(4)}</span>\n  <span>${f(s,2)}</span><span class=\"tot\">$${f(p*s,0)}</span>\n  <span class=\"wallethash\">${hash()} · #${(18442917+Math.floor(Math.random()*9)).toLocaleString('en-US')}</span>`;\n  list.prepend(el);\n  while(list.children.length>9) list.lastChild.remove();\n}\nfor(let i=0;i<9;i++) trade();\n(function loopTrade(){ trade(); setTimeout(loopTrade, rn(500,1600)); })();\n\n/* ---------- live price ---------- */\nconst open24=122.51;\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  const last=candles[candles.length-1];\n  price=Math.max(1,price*(1+(Math.random()-0.497)*0.0035));\n  last.c=price; last.h=Math.max(last.h,price); last.l=Math.min(last.l,price); last.v+=rn(0,9);\n  const up=price>=open24;\n  const bp=$('#bigPrice'); bp.textContent=price.toFixed(4);\n  bp.className=up?'up':'dn';\n  const pill=$('#chgPill'); const chg=(price/open24-1)*100;\n  pill.textContent=(chg>=0?'+':'')+chg.toFixed(2)+'%'; pill.className='chg '+(chg>=0?'up':'dn');\n  $('#hi').textContent=Math.max(131.9042,price).toFixed(4);\n  render(); book();\n  if($('#typeSeg .on').textContent==='Market') $('#fPrice').value=price.toFixed(4);\n},1400);\n\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  const last=candles[candles.length-1];\n  candles.push({o:last.c,h:last.c*1.001,l:last.c*0.999,c:last.c,v:rn(80,260)});\n  if(candles.length>N) candles.shift();\n  render();\n},13000);\n\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  $('#block').textContent=(18442917+Math.floor(Math.random()*40)).toLocaleString('en-US');\n  const s=4118.9+rn(-260,320); $('#sess').textContent=(s>=0?'+$':'−$')+f(Math.abs(s));\n},2600);\n\n/* ---------- ticket ---------- */\nlet side='buy';\nfunction setSide(s){\n  side=s;\n  $('#tabBuy').classList.toggle('on',s==='buy'); $('#tabSell').classList.toggle('on',s==='sell');\n  const b=$('#submitBtn'); b.classList.toggle('sell',s==='sell');\n  b.textContent=s==='buy'?'Buy TRMP':'Sell TRMP';\n  const sl=$('#slider'); sl.style.setProperty('background',\n    `linear-gradient(90deg, ${s==='buy'?'#39ff14':'#5bd1ff'} ${sl.value}%, rgba(255,255,255,.1) ${sl.value}%)`);\n}\n$('#tabBuy').onclick=()=>setSide('buy'); $('#tabSell').onclick=()=>setSide('sell');\n$('#typeSeg').addEventListener('click',e=>{ if(e.target.tagName==='BUTTON'){\n  [...$('#typeSeg').children].forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('on')); e.target.classList.add('on');\n  if(e.target.textContent==='Market'){$('#fPrice').value=price.toFixed(4);} }});\nfunction recalc(){\n  const p=parseFloat($('#fPrice').value.replace(/,/g,''))||price;\n  const a=parseFloat($('#fAmt').value.replace(/,/g,''))||0;\n  $('#fTot').value=f(p*a); $('#fee').textContent=f(p*a*0.0002)+' USDC';\n}\n['#fPrice','#fAmt'].forEach(s=>$(s).addEventListener('input',recalc));\n$('#fTot').addEventListener('input',()=>{\n  const p=parseFloat($('#fPrice').value.replace(/,/g,''))||price;\n  const t=parseFloat($('#fTot').value.replace(/,/g,''))||0;\n  $('#fAmt').value=f(t/p); $('#fee').textContent=f(t*0.0002)+' USDC';\n});\nfunction setPct(v){\n  $('#slider').value=v;\n  $('#slider').style.background=`linear-gradient(90deg, ${side==='buy'?'#39ff14':'#5bd1ff'} ${v}%, rgba(255,255,255,.1) ${v}%)`;\n  const p=parseFloat($('#fPrice').value.replace(/,/g,''))||price;\n  $('#fAmt').value=f(96540*v/100/p); recalc();\n}\n$('#slider').addEventListener('input',e=>setPct(+e.target.value));\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.chips button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setPct(+b.dataset.p));\n$('#submitBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{\n  const b=$('#submitBtn'), o=b.textContent;\n  b.textContent='◇ Order routed · pending'; b.style.filter='brightness(.8)';\n  setTimeout(()=>{b.textContent='✓ Filled on block '+$('#block').textContent;},900);\n  setTimeout(()=>{b.textContent=o;b.style.filter='';},2400);\n});\nsetSide('buy'); setPct(25);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "at": 1790349411501}]}